    "A List is a collection of multiple items stored in a single variable.\n",
    "Features of Lists\n",
    "Ordered\n",
    "Mutable (can be modified)\n",
    "Allows duplicate values\n",
    "Can store different data types\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "b1e0e890-7ad4-4a4c-b2d0-b3d69cdd3dd0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "['Apple', 'Orange', 'Mango']\n",
      "Apple\n",
      "Orange\n",
      "Orange\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "fruits = [\"Apple\", \"Orange\", \"Mango\"]\n",
    "print(fruits)\n",
    "print(fruits[0])\n",
    "print(fruits[1])\n",
    "print(fruits[-2])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "f76d311d-d146-4e75-8f4e-d8aff5daeb4a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "['Adithya', 25, 75.5, True]\n",
      "True\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "mixed = [\"Adithya\", 25, 75.5, True]\n",
    "print(mixed)\n",
    "print(mixed[-1])\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "baad05b6-c89e-4376-8892-ba2e744ad59a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**LIST METHODS**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ec14fc0e-f4bf-4f05-84d6-f2e154969490",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**APPEND**\n",
    "\n",
    "Adds an element to the end of the list.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "71b936c0-052c-4912-b41d-50916af17c06",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "['Apple', 'Orange', 'Mango']\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "fruits=[\"Apple\",\"Orange\"]\n",
    "fruits.append(\"Mango\")\n",
    "print(fruits)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8aa5cb36-8517-4f85-b34b-3eddbf59b15f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**INSERT()**\n",
    "\n",
    "Adds an element at a specific position.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "c9f790ce-6fcd-422c-ad53-52580ad453a7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "['Apple', 'Orange', 'Mango']\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "fruits = [\"Apple\", \"Mango\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "fruits.insert(1, \"Orange\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(fruits)\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "360f3484-b52e-41b8-96eb-f8a3443d9b76",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**extend()**\n",
    "\n",
    "Adds multiple elements.\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "id": "46a459c8-8e8a-49a4-908e-71ec69eaaad0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "['Apple', 'Orange']\n",
      "['Apple', 'Orange', 'Mango', 'Grapes']\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "fruits = [\"Apple\", \"Orange\"]\n",
    "print(fruits)\n",
    "fruits.extend([\"Mango\", \"Grapes\"])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(fruits)\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1f547110-2613-4626-8522-f13dc71184ec",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**REMOVE()**\n",
    "\n",
    "Removes a specific value."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "id": "8391115c-ba9c-4f32-9593-f467f269644b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "['Apple', 'Mango']\n",
      "['Apple']\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "fruits = [\"Apple\", \"Orange\", \"Mango\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "fruits.remove(\"Orange\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(fruits)\n",
    "\n",
    "fruits.remove(\"Mango\")\n",
    "print(fruits)\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cd3b4b32-c595-45ed-8627-1c2bc4ea8ffb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**POP**\n",
    "\n",
    "Removes an element using index.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 18,
   "id": "18f44562-6447-4a2a-a67b-4fa97cf73e8e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[11, 12, 14]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "numbers = [11,12,13,14]\n",
    "numbers.pop(2)\n",
    "print(numbers)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "deb9eae5-9d43-454b-b668-c736a3ab48c3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**POP WITHOUT INDEX**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 19,
   "id": "5ea07768-859a-4531-a5bc-00921510e915",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[10, 20]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "numbers = [10, 20, 30]\n",
    "numbers.pop()\n",
    "print(numbers)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "bbc76ea8-1e13-4dcd-a940-fadaca9491dc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**CLEAR()**\n",
    "\n",
    "Removes all elements."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 20,
   "id": "264200cb-8fc3-48c9-b8b2-32dbbc917494",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "numbers = [10, 20, 30]\n",
    "numbers.clear()\n",
    "print(numbers)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1e5fbb1a-dc2f-48db-96e4-892e64f5a3a5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**INDEX()**\n",
    "\n",
    "Returns the position of an element.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 21,
   "id": "b18f3d99-0f70-468e-94fb-15de69d3dc34",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "1\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "fruits = [\"Apple\", \"Orange\", \"Mango\"]\n",
    "print(fruits.index(\"Orange\"))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "811a7c5f-fcbe-413a-9966-8e6f323d72ea",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**count()**\n",
    "\n",
    "Counts occurrences of an element.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 22,
   "id": "75a6d4fb-abe2-4197-b3b4-3c75ec72f5cf",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "3\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "numbers = [10, 20, 10, 30, 10]\n",
    "print(numbers.count(10))\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "95f5226e-8313-412d-b2c1-63e4994543c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**sort()**\n",
    "Sorts the list.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 24,
   "id": "4fce064b-fc8a-456f-9647-2fc743f5b0f0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[10, 20, 30, 50]\n",
      "[50, 30, 20, 10]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "numbers = [50, 10, 30, 20]\n",
    "numbers.sort()\n",
    "print(numbers)\n",
    "numbers.sort(reverse=True)\n",
    "print(numbers)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "90400c61-76a3-4f3d-826d-714c765c9044",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**copy()**\n",
    "\n",
    "Creates a duplicate/copy of the list.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 25,
   "id": "a218a7cf-4bae-46a3-952b-4ba30154ad84",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[10, 20, 30]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "list1 = [10,20,30]\n",
    "list2 = list1.copy()\n",
    "print(list2)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 27,
   "id": "8ac15e1a-d1e2-4c72-b662-e3c8f1b242b5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[12, 23, 'fruit']\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "list = [12,23,\"fruit\"]\n",
    "list2 = list.copy()\n",
    "print(list2)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "27320ad5-766f-46f3-affb-32d0a8f88a87",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**LIST SLICING**\n",
    "\n",
    "List slicing allows us to extract a portion of a list.\n",
    "Syntax\n",
    "list[start:stop:step]\n",
    "\n",
    "Where:\n",
    "start → Starting index\n",
    "stop → Ending index (not included)\n",
    "step → Increment value\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dbfd112e-0528-4df9-9643-809c11b2060d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Basic Slicing**\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 28,
   "id": "90bec1d5-f3f2-4c82-b52b-f03a1e684c5e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[20, 30, 40]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "numbers = [10,20,30,40,50,60]\n",
    "print(numbers[1:4])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "24dcf442-dd81-4665-8a2b-0b55eb9732cc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**From Beginning**\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 29,
   "id": "d285361b-bcc8-4686-8ba9-d2bd3c7463ca",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[10, 20, 30, 40]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "numbers = [10,20,30,40,50,60]\n",
    "print(numbers[:4])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "869c2ec3-23a9-495a-9f85-42bdb4b0ab53",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Till End**\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 30,
   "id": "b51266d0-0cc5-47fa-a6fa-bc72ee9fb2e5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[30, 40, 50, 60]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "numbers = [10,20,30,40,50,60]\n",
    "print(numbers[2:])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0e5ac9e6-c4ef-4d65-8a24-3b51e2dbf52d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Entire List**\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 31,
   "id": "7e12ec85-b929-49b2-b4e9-876ddae80a3f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[10, 20, 30, 40]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "numbers = [10,20,30,40]\n",
    "print(numbers[:])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f8f32179-1ca8-45a7-8e19-1cbc88f28b21",
